      "titleclass": "h2",
      "body": [
        "Jupiter steps from Cancer into Leo through Gandanta, the knot where water meets fire",
        "Ketu waits just ahead; Mars, at its weakest, follows"
      ],
      "bodysize": 36,
      "closing": "What you borrowed gets tested\nby what you lived"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "label": "Act 2 · 12 to 18 Nov",
      "labelsize": 24,
      "title": "The knot",
      "titleclass": "h2",
      "body": [
        "Mars crosses the same doorway on 12 Nov",
        "From 13 to 16 Nov, all three are within one degree",
        "Mercury and Venus turn forward on 13 Nov"
      ],
      "bodysize": 36,
      "closing": "Stuck decisions move fast;\ndrive and speak with care"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "label": "Act 3 · 5 to 12 Dec",
      "labelsize": 24,
      "title": "The release",
      "titleclass": "h2",
      "body": [
        "Ketu slips back into Cancer on 5 Dec",
        "Saturn turns forward on 10 Dec",
        "Jupiter pauses on 12 Dec"
      ],
      "bodysize": 36,
      "closing": "What was borrowed falls away;\nwhat's yours stays",
      "note": "2027: they meet again, about 1 Mar and 19 Apr"
